{
  "_comment": [
    "Cross-language MCP wire conformance cases. Generated from the Go",
    "surface — do not hand-edit. Regenerate with:",
    "  go test ./go/transport/cmdsurface/ -run TestGenerateMCPWireFixtures \\",
    "      -update-mcp-fixtures",
    "",
    "Each case posts `request` (verbatim bytes) to the mount with",
    "`headers` applied, and asserts the response is byte-identical to",
    "`response` and the HTTP status equals `status`. Byte-identical",
    "means exactly that: no JSON decode/re-encode before comparing.",
    "Go emits objects with lexicographically sorted keys and a trailing",
    "newline; a runtime whose serializer differs must reorder to match,",
    "not normalize the comparison.",
    "",
    "`mount` lists MountMCP options for the case, as `name=value`",
    "tokens. Absent means default mount: both eras, path /mcp, empty",
    "origin allowlist, cache hints ttlMs=0 / cacheScope=private.",
    "",
    "`era` is which handler must serve the request (legacy = 2024-11-05,",
    "modern = 2026-07-28). It is documentation for the runner author,",
    "not an input: era is detected per-request from the markers in",
    "ADR 0042, and a port that routes a case to the wrong handler will",
    "fail on the response bytes anyway.",
    "",
    "See ADR 0043 for the polyglot surface design and ADR 0042 for the",
    "normative era-detection rules."
  ],
  "command_tree": "legacyLockTree (see surface_mcp_legacy_lock_test.go)",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "legacy/initialize/defaults",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "handshake response pins protocolVersion + default serverInfo",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"initialize\"}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"result\":{\"capabilities\":{\"tools\":{}},\"protocolVersion\":\"2024-11-05\",\"serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"cmdsurface\",\"version\":\"0.0.0\"}}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/initialize/null-id",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "id round-trips verbatim including null",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":null,\"method\":\"initialize\"}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":null,\"result\":{\"capabilities\":{\"tools\":{}},\"protocolVersion\":\"2024-11-05\",\"serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"cmdsurface\",\"version\":\"0.0.0\"}}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/tools-list",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "tool enumeration, hidden and deprecated flags excluded",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"method\":\"tools/list\"}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"result\":{\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Deploy\",\"inputSchema\":{\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"},\"name\":\"deploy\"},{\"description\":\"Ping the server\",\"inputSchema\":{\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"},\"name\":\"ping\"},{\"description\":\"Locked\",\"inputSchema\":{\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"},\"name\":\"secret\"},{\"description\":\"Add a widget\",\"inputSchema\":{\"properties\":{\"count\":{\"description\":\"widget count\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"force\":{\"description\":\"force flag\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"widget name\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"tag\":{\"description\":\"tag list\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"name\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"name\":\"widget.add\"},{\"description\":\"Delete a widget\",\"inputSchema\":{\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"},\"name\":\"widget.delete\"}]}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/tools-call/read",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "non-destructive leaf invokes and returns stdout content block",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":3,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"ping\"}}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":3,\"result\":{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"pong\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"isError\":false}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/tools-call/destructive-blocked",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "destructive leaf blocked by default policy: isError result at HTTP 200",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":4,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"widget.delete\"}}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":4,\"result\":{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"cmdsurface: destructive command blocked on this surface: widget delete on mcp\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"isError\":true}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/tools-call/auth-required",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "auth-required leaf without Authorization header",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":5,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"secret\"}}",
      "status": 401,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":5,\"result\":{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"authentication required\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"isError\":true}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/error/method-not-found",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "-32601 for an unknown JSON-RPC method",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":6,\"method\":\"nope\"}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":6,\"error\":{\"code\":-32601,\"message\":\"method not found: nope\"}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/error/parse",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "-32700 at HTTP 400 for unparseable JSON, regardless of headers",
      "request": "{not json",
      "status": 400,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"error\":{\"code\":-32700,\"message\":\"parse error: invalid character 'n' looking for beginning of object key string\"}}\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "legacy/meta-progress-token-is-not-modern",
      "era": "legacy",
      "why": "bare params._meta is NOT a modern marker: progressToken stays legacy",
      "request": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":7,\"method\":\"initialize\",\"params\":{\"_meta\":{\"progressToken\":\"p1\"}}}",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":7,\"result\":{\"capabilities\":{\"tools\":{}},\"protocolVersion\":\"2024-11-05\",\"serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"cmdsurface\",\"version\":\"0.0.0\"}}}\n"
    },
